{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（标注）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ (Marked Up)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 个文件 · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld file · %@"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld files · %@"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**相册写入权限（可选）**：仅在您主动选择，或开启「照片和视频自动存到相册」后，将接收到的图片和视频保存到相册时使用。本应用不读取您相册中的任何内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Add to Photos (optional):** used only when you choose to save a received photo or video to your library, or turn on “Auto-Save to Photos”. The app never reads anything in your library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**相机权限（必需）**：仅用于扫描发送端的彩色动画码。该权限只在「扫码」页激活时使用，画面仅在本机内存中实时解码，不会被存储或上传。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Camera (required):** used only to scan the sender's animated color code, and only while the Scan tab is active. Frames are decoded in memory on the device and are never stored or uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**请勿用于传输商业机密、个人隐私文件等敏感内容**" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Do not use it to transfer sensitive content such as trade secrets or private personal files**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 天后" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After 30 Days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "7 天后" : {
      "localizations" : {
