    "「文件」App 通常只能解压 zip；.%@ 压缩包可以用「分享」交给能解压的 App。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Files app usually unzips only .zip files. Use Share to open this .%@ archive in an app that can unpack it."
          }
        }
      }
