    },
    "本协议可能不时更新，我们会在应用内告知您。如您不同意更新后的协议，应停止使用本应用。您也可随时通过卸载本应用终止本协议。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These terms may be updated from time to time, and we will let you know in the app. If you do not agree to the updated terms, stop using the app. You can end this agreement at any time by deleting the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本协议适用中华人民共和国法律。如发生争议，应通过友好协商解决；协商不成的，可向开发者所在地人民法院提起诉讼。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These terms are governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China. Disputes should first be resolved through friendly negotiation; if that fails, either party may bring a claim before the people's court where the developer is located."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用 **不会** 将任何数据上传至任何服务器，也不与第三方共享。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app **does not** upload any data to any server and does not share data with third parties."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用 **不收集** 您的任何个人信息，包括但不限于：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app **does not collect** any of your personal information, including but not limited to:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用不提供发送功能，也不提供任何在线服务。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app has no sending feature and provides no online services."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用基于 libcimbar 开源项目（Mozilla Public License 2.0）实现解码。其传输方式本质上是公开的视觉编码，不进行加密：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app decodes using the open-source libcimbar project (Mozilla Public License 2.0). The transfer is a public visual encoding and is not encrypted:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用按「现状」提供，不对以下事项作任何明示或暗示的保证：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app is provided “as is”, without any express or implied warranty as to:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用提供基于 libcimbar 协议的离线文件接收功能：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app receives files offline using the libcimbar protocol:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用本身不产生、不审核、不存储任何文件内容到我们的服务器：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app does not create or review file content, and stores none of it on our servers:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用的所有权及知识产权由开发者所有，但其中使用的 libcimbar 等开源组件遵循各自的开源许可证（详见「开源许可」页面）。未经允许，您不得反编译、反向工程或修改本应用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app and its intellectual property belong to the developer, except that open-source components such as libcimbar are governed by their own licenses (see the Open Source Licenses page). You may not decompile, reverse engineer or modify the app without permission."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用面向 4 岁以上用户，不针对未成年人收集任何信息。如发现误收集请联系我们删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app is rated for ages 4 and up and does not collect any information from minors. If you believe information was collected by mistake, contact us and we will delete it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本政策可能不时更新。重大变更将在应用内显著位置告知您。继续使用本应用即视为您同意更新后的政策。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This policy may be updated from time to time. We will announce significant changes prominently in the app. Continuing to use the app means you accept the updated policy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本隐私政策仅适用于「萤传」iOS 客户端（以下简称「本应用」）。本应用是一款离线的文件接收工具，使用 libcimbar 协议在本机解码相机捕获到的彩色动画码。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This privacy policy applies only to the Lumen iOS app (“the app”). The app is an offline file receiver that decodes animated color codes captured by the camera, on the device, using the libcimbar protocol."
          }
        }
      }
    },
